title: "Induced Superfluid Cosmology: A Unified Framework for Emergent Gravity, Matter, and Dark Energy"
abstract: >-
  Research report and complete reproducibility package for the TRXT-Nullivance
  framework: induced gravity and matter as topological solitons in a superfluid
  vacuum condensate. Includes a 13-script independent verification suite with
  committed logs, a validation-gate runner with frozen ledger-logged criteria,
  and real-data confrontations (Planck 2018 CMB spectra, SPARC rotation curves,
  Cassini bounds, PRyMordial BBN).
